Flashing stopped                                    ○
Into the bootloader with the 1200-baud touch, then
the erase (10 s).
Writing went on for 38 s, the board answering every
frame, until frame 212 had no answer.
It was sent again twice, with no answer either time,
and then the port went away.
Its app is erased.
Press r; meshflash then asks you to press reset twice
quickly.
Press r to try again: the file is saved, so no Wi-Fi
is needed.

